For more information, see the performance schema section in [Overview of burstable instances](https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/59977.html).', example='Standard'),
  customPriorities?: [ 
    {
      instanceType?: string(name='InstanceType', description='The instance type of the ECS instance.

>Notice: The instance type must be included in the instance type list of the scaling configuration.', example='ecs.g6.large'),
