- After you configure this parameter, you cannot configure Ipv6AddressCount.', example='1'),
      networkInterfaceTrafficMode?: string(name='NetworkInterfaceTrafficMode', description='The communication pattern of the network interface controller (NIC). Valid values of the parameter:

