          weight?: int32(name='Weight', description='The weight of the instance as a backend server after Auto Scaling adds the instance to the virtual server group. A higher weight indicates that more access requests are allocated to the instance. If the weight is 0, the instance does not receive access requests. Valid values: 0 to 100.

