You must specify both `RecurrenceType` and `RecurrenceValue`.', example='Daily'),
  recurrenceValue?: string(name='RecurrenceValue', description='The recurrence value of the scheduled task. 

- If `RecurrenceType` is set to `Daily`, you can enter only one value. Valid values: 1 to 31. 
